%% TRIP-012 Book a flight
%% From the folded cards on /flyg/plan to the summary. Labels give the requirement.
flowchart TD
    A["/flyg/plan: every card folded"] -- Fortsätt R1 --> B["/flyg/boka (Resenärer)"]
    B --> C[Saved form from the tab, fitted to the trip: a changed flight starts its classes over without add-ons R10]
    C --> D[Passengers, classes, add-ons, Dåliga nerver, contact, three questions; total at once R1–R6]
    D -- Till betalning, something wrong --> E[Fields red with messages, focus on the first R2 R5 R6]
    E --> D
    D -- Till betalning, all valid --> F["/flyg/boka/betala (Betala)"]
    F -- no method chosen, Betala --> G[Välj hur du vill betala. R7]
    G --> F
    F -- Tillbaka / step Resenärer --> C
    D -- step Plan och klass or Flyg --> A
    F -- Betala --> H[Server action: departures, aircraft, add-ons and prices read in one transaction R8]
    H -- something changed or invalid --> I[Message on the payment page, nothing saved R8]
    H -- same request id again --> J[The booking already saved R8]
    H -- valid --> K[Booking saved with a new booking number R8]
    J --> L["/flyg/bokad: summary from the tab R9"]
    K --> L
    M[Another visitor opens /flyg/bokad] --> N[Ingen bokning R9]
